(6088824, 897053, 113634, '<td valign="top">i really like the photo,but i''m not a fan of the center color fade, but other wise great photo</td>', 'i really like the photo,but i''m not a fan of the center color fade, but other wise great photo', '2010-07-12 01:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088829, 896962, 36843, '<td valign="top">great processing</td>', 'great processing', '2010-07-12 01:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088836, 896481, 36843, '<td valign="top">outstanding , dodge and burn are perfect</td>', 'outstanding , dodge and burn are perfect', '2010-07-12 01:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088906, 896922, 112828, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is, but it doesn''t strike me as particularly weathered.... I wish I could tell what they are!<br/> <br/>I''m afraid I can''t score this nearly as well as it deserves as a photo on it''s own merit.  Whoever you are, this is a great image.. Wrong challenge though I think..  Sorry! <br/> <br/>5...</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is, but it doesn''t strike me as particularly weathered.... I wish I could tell what they are! I''m afraid I can''t score this nearly as well as it deserves as a photo on it''s own merit.  Whoever you are, this is a great image.. Wrong challenge though I think..  Sorry!  5...', '2010-07-12 02:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088916, 897109, 112828, '<td valign="top">Oh man... I think you missed a great opportunity!!!<br/> <br/>The barn in the background is super cool weathered goodness... The well pump?  It may be old, but it''s not very weathered..  Darn.<br/> <br/>Still a 5 for technical merit...</td>', 'Oh man... I think you missed a great opportunity!!! The barn in the background is super cool weathered goodness... The well pump?  It may be old, but it''s not very weathered..  Darn. Still a 5 for technical merit...', '2010-07-12 02:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088918, 897006, 112828, '<td valign="top">What is that that has been shot by a shotgun?  A sign? <br/> <br/>Interesting in any case, and certainly worse for wear. 6</td>', 'What is that that has been shot by a shotgun?  A sign?  Interesting in any case, and certainly worse for wear. 6', '2010-07-12 02:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088921, 896677, 112828, '<td valign="top">Great shadow, and a cool subject!<br/> <br/>I wish the highlights weren''t blown and the DOF was a bit deeper... 6</td>', 'Great shadow, and a cool subject! I wish the highlights weren''t blown and the DOF was a bit deeper... 6', '2010-07-12 02:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088929, 897159, 112828, '<td valign="top">Image looks a bit soft and a touch low contrast... Wonderful location and superbly interesting subject.<br/> <br/>6, but it could have been an 8 with a little different processing..</td>', 'Image looks a bit soft and a touch low contrast... Wonderful location and superbly interesting subject. 6, but it could have been an 8 with a little different processing..', '2010-07-12 02:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088934, 896851, 112828, '<td valign="top">I love the dynamic relationship between the flowers and rust here.<br/> <br/>Processing is a bit of a letdown for me, but perhaps it''s appropriate for the image.  6.</td>', 'I love the dynamic relationship between the flowers and rust here. Processing is a bit of a letdown for me, but perhaps it''s appropriate for the image.  6.', '2010-07-12 02:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088947, 896818, 112828, '<td valign="top">Superb!  A solid 9</td>', 'Superb!  A solid 9', '2010-07-12 02:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088956, 896365, 112828, '<td valign="top">DOF is way to shallow here.  Shame too, as a bit more DOF would have really made this pop.</td>', 'DOF is way to shallow here.  Shame too, as a bit more DOF would have really made this pop.', '2010-07-12 02:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088957, 897139, 112828, '<td valign="top">Great shot... Little soft..</td>', 'Great shot... Little soft..', '2010-07-12 02:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088960, 896138, 112828, '<td valign="top">Where I have I seen this before...  Oh that''s right..  I think I suggested that this would be more appropriate here.. And it is.. 9</td>', 'Where I have I seen this before...  Oh that''s right..  I think I suggested that this would be more appropriate here.. And it is.. 9', '2010-07-12 02:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088968, 896966, 112828, '<td valign="top">Amazingly similar to a shot in the objects side challenge... :)</td>', 'Amazingly similar to a shot in the objects side challenge... :)', '2010-07-12 02:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088981, 897152, 112828, '<td valign="top">So, tell me, how is a child weathered?  Damn..  1.  Shame too because it''s a cute picture.</td>', 'So, tell me, how is a child weathered?  Damn..  1.  Shame too because it''s a cute picture.', '2010-07-12 02:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088984, 896715, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great shapes, lighting, contrast, processing.</td>', 'Great shapes, lighting, contrast, processing.', '2010-07-12 02:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088990, 896916, 112828, '<td valign="top">Weather?  No, this is a weathered challenge...</td>', 'Weather?  No, this is a weathered challenge...', '2010-07-12 02:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088991, 896960, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is just so good.  Fabulous processing, very artsy and moody - really brings out the sky and that lone, ghostly bird.  The grass even seems to be swaying in the cold wind.</td>', 'This is just so good.  Fabulous processing, very artsy and moody - really brings out the sky and that lone, ghostly bird.  The grass even seems to be swaying in the cold wind.', '2010-07-12 02:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088994, 896062, 96751, '<td valign="top">The fisheye works well here, but the lighting is a bit flat on the main subject.</td>', 'The fisheye works well here, but the lighting is a bit flat on the main subject.', '2010-07-12 02:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6088999, 896481, 96751, '<td valign="top">Overall a good shot, very interesting subject, nice low angle, fabulous sky.  Just wish it was a teensy bit lighter.  Should finish on the front page.</td>', 'Overall a good shot, very interesting subject, nice low angle, fabulous sky.  Just wish it was a teensy bit lighter.  Should finish on the front page.', '2010-07-12 02:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089001, 896956, 96751, '<td valign="top">Arresting image.  An out of the box interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Arresting image.  An out of the box interpretation of the challenge.', '2010-07-12 02:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089002, 896978, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful remnants.  The smaller stump is fascinating.  Makes me wonder what kind of wood that is.</td>', 'Wonderful remnants.  The smaller stump is fascinating.  Makes me wonder what kind of wood that is.', '2010-07-12 02:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089006, 896138, 37252, '<td valign="top">I really like the lines created here. Nice details too.</td>', 'I really like the lines created here. Nice details too.', '2010-07-12 02:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089007, 896975, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m at odds with the processing.  I can''t decide if it really enhances the image or is a distracting element unto itself.  Also, the window is tilting in the opposite direction as the ground so everything looks askew.</td>', 'I''m at odds with the processing.  I can''t decide if it really enhances the image or is a distracting element unto itself.  Also, the window is tilting in the opposite direction as the ground so everything looks askew.', '2010-07-12 02:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089011, 896681, 112828, '<td valign="top">Ohh man, another "weather" image with nothing weathered in sight, except perhaps the shoes, but that''s a real stretch..  Just because the shoes are there you''re getting a 3, but it would have been a 1 without them, and perhaps more if they were really the subject..</td>', 'Ohh man, another "weather" image with nothing weathered in sight, except perhaps the shoes, but that''s a real stretch..  Just because the shoes are there you''re getting a 3, but it would have been a 1 without them, and perhaps more if they were really the subject..', '2010-07-12 02:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089013, 896062, 37252, '<td valign="top">I personally like the fish-eye look. I think it works great with land/water shots. Nice work</td>', 'I personally like the fish-eye look. I think it works great with land/water shots. Nice work', '2010-07-12 02:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089020, 896937, 112828, '<td valign="top">Did you think this was the weather challenge?  Darn... I hate giving this a 1, I really, really do, but it''s 100% DNMC DNRD.. Darn. This is a great image, really super nice, but you''ve totally blown the challenge.<br/> <br/>Sorry!!</td>', 'Did you think this was the weather challenge?  Darn... I hate giving this a 1, I really, really do, but it''s 100% DNMC DNRD.. Darn. This is a great image, really super nice, but you''ve totally blown the challenge. Sorry!!', '2010-07-12 02:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089026, 896722, 86447, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL image... well composed and thought out.<br/> <br/>I hate that you have the typo in your title, though. (not voting)</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL image... well composed and thought out. I hate that you have the typo in your title, though. (not voting)', '2010-07-12 03:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
