(6089028, 896984, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and processing.  The tilt increases visual interest.  Great processing.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and processing.  The tilt increases visual interest.  Great processing.', '2010-07-12 03:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089031, 897006, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great abstract macro.  Great metallics and interesting subject.</td>', 'Great abstract macro.  Great metallics and interesting subject.', '2010-07-12 03:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089033, 897170, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great color study.</td>', 'Great color study.', '2010-07-12 03:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089038, 897028, 86447, '<td valign="top">Cool clouds.  (not voting)</td>', 'Cool clouds.  (not voting)', '2010-07-12 03:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089041, 896061, 96751, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful composition, depth, and love the narrow color band - very effective and gives it a rather "glowy" look.  The intense storm in the background is a great counterpoint to the peaceful foreground.  Great image.  I think even a tiny border might have contained the scene a bit better.</td>', 'Really wonderful composition, depth, and love the narrow color band - very effective and gives it a rather "glowy" look.  The intense storm in the background is a great counterpoint to the peaceful foreground.  Great image.  I think even a tiny border might have contained the scene a bit better.', '2010-07-12 03:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089044, 897167, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like the dof field, with the horse adding a mood and some visual interest beyond the tangle of barbed wire.</td>', 'I like the dof field, with the horse adding a mood and some visual interest beyond the tangle of barbed wire.', '2010-07-12 03:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089048, 897115, 86447, '<td valign="top">adorable!  (not voting)</td>', 'adorable!  (not voting)', '2010-07-12 03:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089049, 896138, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great treatment on an interesting architectural.  I love the lines, the bold colors, the texture of the large wall.  Compositionally, I would have cropped a little more off the left, as to my eye it neither quite fit the rule of thirds, or is centered.</td>', 'Great treatment on an interesting architectural.  I love the lines, the bold colors, the texture of the large wall.  Compositionally, I would have cropped a little more off the left, as to my eye it neither quite fit the rule of thirds, or is centered.', '2010-07-12 03:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089053, 896809, 96751, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting.  Well processed.</td>', 'Perfect lighting.  Well processed.', '2010-07-12 03:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089058, 896722, 96751, '<td valign="top">The colors on this are gorgeous.  Wonderful depth of feel, and great detail on the foreground stumps.  The marina beyond looks like a backdrop.  Nicely done.</td>', 'The colors on this are gorgeous.  Wonderful depth of feel, and great detail on the foreground stumps.  The marina beyond looks like a backdrop.  Nicely done.', '2010-07-12 03:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089060, 897096, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great door!  I almost wish you''d given it just a little more breathing room on either side.</td>', 'Great door!  I almost wish you''d given it just a little more breathing room on either side.', '2010-07-12 03:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089061, 897163, 96751, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what I''m looking at.  Is this from the air?</td>', 'I can''t tell what I''m looking at.  Is this from the air?', '2010-07-12 03:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089062, 896959, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  The green background shows off both the shape and colors of the iron curl.</td>', 'Nice macro.  The green background shows off both the shape and colors of the iron curl.', '2010-07-12 03:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089063, 897151, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting facade.  Something is missing to give it that "pop".  But well seen.</td>', 'Very interesting facade.  Something is missing to give it that "pop".  But well seen.', '2010-07-12 03:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089064, 897164, 96751, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the processing on this.  I''m torn as to whether or not the sunbather improves or detracts from the shot.  But I think it transforms this from being just another shot of driftwood to something with a story.  Hope you''ll share your processing steps.</td>', 'I LOVE the processing on this.  I''m torn as to whether or not the sunbather improves or detracts from the shot.  But I think it transforms this from being just another shot of driftwood to something with a story.  Hope you''ll share your processing steps.', '2010-07-12 03:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089066, 897105, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting artifact.</td>', 'Very interesting artifact.', '2010-07-12 03:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089068, 897173, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting.</td>', 'Love the lighting.', '2010-07-12 03:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089070, 896962, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting detailing...  This is way to processed for my taste, but seems to be very popular with most voters.</td>', 'Interesting detailing...  This is way to processed for my taste, but seems to be very popular with most voters.', '2010-07-12 03:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089072, 897064, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen, although I think just a tad more contrast would have brought out a bit of the wood grain detail.</td>', 'Nicely seen, although I think just a tad more contrast would have brought out a bit of the wood grain detail.', '2010-07-12 03:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
