(6089083, 896455, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is such a palpable mood in this shot.  Delicate lighting, nice lines.  Well done.</td>', 'There is such a palpable mood in this shot.  Delicate lighting, nice lines.  Well done.', '2010-07-12 03:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
