(6089108, 897106, 96574, '<td valign="top">love the colors and the contrast between stationary tree trunk and the movement of the water. great shot. 9</td>', 'love the colors and the contrast between stationary tree trunk and the movement of the water. great shot. 9', '2010-07-12 04:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089109, 896943, 96574, '<td valign="top">so much character in his face. great capture. 8</td>', 'so much character in his face. great capture. 8', '2010-07-12 04:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089110, 896043, 101399, '<td valign="top">I love the atmosphere you captured!</td>', 'I love the atmosphere you captured!', '2010-07-12 04:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089116, 897115, 112828, '<td valign="top">.. Not a weather challenge.  And no, I don''t think the dog is particularly "weathered".<br/> <br/>Cute though.  On creative interpretation you get a 5..<br/> <br/>This must be vawendy..  Yes a creative entry - hence the 5...  But really, it''s a beautiful snapshot, well cropped and nicely processed.<br/> <br/>Still doesn''t strike me as strongly meeting the challenge.  Hence the fact that I gave a 5 on this.  I do think it''s nice, and under other circumstances I might have voted at least a 6 and perhaps as high as a 7.<br/> <br/>Still, do note that there is a huge blown spot on the dog....<br/> <br/>FWIW, I love the use of the frame, it''s superb, but just not enough to really compel me here..<br/> <br/>Sorry Wendy, you know I love your work in general, but this just didn''t do it for me.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>Cory..</td>', '.. Not a weather challenge.  And no, I don''t think the dog is particularly "weathered". Cute though.  On creative interpretation you get a 5.. This must be vawendy..  Yes a creative entry - hence the 5...  But really, it''s a beautiful snapshot, well cropped and nicely processed. Still doesn''t strike me as strongly meeting the challenge.  Hence the fact that I gave a 5 on this.  I do think it''s nice, and under other circumstances I might have voted at least a 6 and perhaps as high as a 7. Still, do note that there is a huge blown spot on the dog.... FWIW, I love the use of the frame, it''s superb, but just not enough to really compel me here.. Sorry Wendy, you know I love your work in general, but this just didn''t do it for me. Cheers,Cory..', '2010-07-12 04:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089136, 896415, 62694, '<td valign="top">Looks way overprocessed...</td>', 'Looks way overprocessed...', '2010-07-12 05:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089179, 896903, 101668, '<td valign="top">Anglo-Boer War. The Brits came to fight the Boers. Real great picture and I am almost certain I recognize the place!</td>', 'Anglo-Boer War. The Brits came to fight the Boers. Real great picture and I am almost certain I recognize the place!', '2010-07-12 07:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089180, 897096, 62694, '<td valign="top">I love old doors...</td>', 'I love old doors...', '2010-07-12 07:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089181, 897175, 62694, '<td valign="top">I like this, but would have toned down the right side... too bright!</td>', 'I like this, but would have toned down the right side... too bright!', '2010-07-12 07:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089191, 897152, 117887, '<td valign="top">i like that you used a fast shutter speed to capture the water in the air (rather than the soft-water affect).  i like the way you also used the category title for more of a current event.  we have a water park like this near my house and my children love it!  this is an excellent shot.  i''m not a member so i can''t vote, but if i could - i''ve give you a 10!  and, she''s a beautiful little girl!</td>', 'i like that you used a fast shutter speed to capture the water in the air (rather than the soft-water affect).  i like the way you also used the category title for more of a current event.  we have a water park like this near my house and my children love it!  this is an excellent shot.  i''m not a member so i can''t vote, but if i could - i''ve give you a 10!  and, she''s a beautiful little girl!', '2010-07-12 07:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089192, 897151, 117887, '<td valign="top">i like the perspective of this composition, and the warmth of the colors.  i also love the science of the title.  i''m not a member so i can''t vote.  but if i could, i''d give you a 10!!!  this is one of my favorites for this week''s weathered challenge.</td>', 'i like the perspective of this composition, and the warmth of the colors.  i also love the science of the title.  i''m not a member so i can''t vote.  but if i could, i''d give you a 10!!!  this is one of my favorites for this week''s weathered challenge.', '2010-07-12 07:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089195, 896519, 97073, '<td valign="top">I think a little more contrast would have helped here.</td>', 'I think a little more contrast would have helped here.', '2010-07-12 07:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089197, 896428, 97073, '<td valign="top">The border is quite distracting here.</td>', 'The border is quite distracting here.', '2010-07-12 07:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
