(6089860, 896962, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, lots going on here..  I think this should do very, very well.. This is an 8 for me.<br/> <br/>ETA, I''ve just noticed Texas written on the windshield..<br/> <br/>I''m thinking that this very well might be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a>''s entry.  This would explain why he is posting such high scores in the thread..  <br/> <br/>If this isn''t <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a>''s image, feel free to laugh at me publicly or privately. :)<br/> <br/>...<br/>Now, I''ve just got to figure out which one is Jeb''s, and why he''s not scoring nearly as well as expected...</td>', 'Very interesting, lots going on here..  I think this should do very, very well.. This is an 8 for me. ETA, I''ve just noticed Texas written on the windshield.. I''m thinking that this very well might be  Yo_Spiff''s entry.  This would explain why he is posting such high scores in the thread..   If this isn''t  Yo_Spiff''s image, feel free to laugh at me publicly or privately. :) ...Now, I''ve just got to figure out which one is Jeb''s, and why he''s not scoring nearly as well as expected...', '2010-07-12 17:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
