(6090072, 897152, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. It is nice and sharp with a crisp focus with good tones and the lighting is niether too dark or too bright. If there is anything I can comment on it would be a personal preference with the sepia tone. I just don''t think the sepia screams summer time because to me it gives the image a slightly cooler feel.</td>', 'I like this photo. It is nice and sharp with a crisp focus with good tones and the lighting is niether too dark or too bright. If there is anything I can comment on it would be a personal preference with the sepia tone. I just don''t think the sepia screams summer time because to me it gives the image a slightly cooler feel.', '2010-07-12 19:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090074, 897028, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the use of slow shutter speed to capture the motion blur of the clouds. That adds interest! You have very good tonal range and everything is crisp and sharp.</td>', 'I like the use of slow shutter speed to capture the motion blur of the clouds. That adds interest! You have very good tonal range and everything is crisp and sharp.', '2010-07-12 19:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
