(6090139, 897108, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice find on the sign adding interest with a cool name... Normal Heights. In the photo I think you did good with the composition. I do think the photo is lacking contrast somewhat to give it a bit more depth.</td>', 'Nice find on the sign adding interest with a cool name... Normal Heights. In the photo I think you did good with the composition. I do think the photo is lacking contrast somewhat to give it a bit more depth.', '2010-07-12 20:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
