(6090150, 896960, 33068, '<td valign="top">Freaking awesome.  Love the feel of this shot and your post processing.   I''d love to know how you created this look.  10</td>', 'Freaking awesome.  Love the feel of this shot and your post processing.   I''d love to know how you created this look.  10', '2010-07-12 20:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090155, 896922, 33068, '<td valign="top">Love the abstract feel to this.   I could totally see this hanging in my somewhere in my house.</td>', 'Love the abstract feel to this.   I could totally see this hanging in my somewhere in my house.', '2010-07-12 20:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090165, 896138, 33068, '<td valign="top">LOVE how you composed this and the yellow and grey really compliment each other.   Beautiful work.</td>', 'LOVE how you composed this and the yellow and grey really compliment each other.   Beautiful work.', '2010-07-12 20:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090203, 897145, 75618, '<td valign="top">Left the "z" comment by accident. Must have accidentally leaned on the keyboard somehow. Anyway, since I can''t delete it, might as well leave a real one... The PP is great, it emphasizes the textures without the "cartoony" topaz look. The integration of the birdhouse with the environment is great. I think a slightly higher perspective would have been better though. 7</td>', 'Left the "z" comment by accident. Must have accidentally leaned on the keyboard somehow. Anyway, since I can''t delete it, might as well leave a real one... The PP is great, it emphasizes the textures without the "cartoony" topaz look. The integration of the birdhouse with the environment is great. I think a slightly higher perspective would have been better though. 7', '2010-07-12 21:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090211, 896940, 86799, '<td valign="top">Processing too dominant and obvious, IMO.</td>', 'Processing too dominant and obvious, IMO.', '2010-07-12 21:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090217, 896481, 57447, '<td valign="top">Great choice for this challenge.</td>', 'Great choice for this challenge.', '2010-07-12 21:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090224, 896379, 73942, '<td valign="top">Acadie - curious to know whose this is</td>', 'Acadie - curious to know whose this is', '2010-07-12 22:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090236, 896915, 57447, '<td valign="top">Great find for this challenge.</td>', 'Great find for this challenge.', '2010-07-12 22:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090269, 897073, 112828, '<td valign="top">Brand new. Not weathered.. Damn you people ;)... You''re just murdering my average vote!  There are several DNMC''s for me in this challenge, and in this case it appears as though it''s an attempt at the brown..  <br/> <br/>So, here''s a 10.. Enjoy it.  - Either on the grounds of being a genius, or as an attempt to thwart an attempt for the brown..<br/> <br/>Of course I can see it''s a thermometer, it just doesn''t look like it''s been affect by the weather, it simply seems to be measuring it...</td>', 'Brand new. Not weathered.. Damn you people ;)... You''re just murdering my average vote!  There are several DNMC''s for me in this challenge, and in this case it appears as though it''s an attempt at the brown..   So, here''s a 10.. Enjoy it.  - Either on the grounds of being a genius, or as an attempt to thwart an attempt for the brown.. Of course I can see it''s a thermometer, it just doesn''t look like it''s been affect by the weather, it simply seems to be measuring it...', '2010-07-12 22:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090270, 897116, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very excellent image... I love the mood created here.  The sharpness is quite perfect really, I can''t really ask for much more here, as you''ve made the very most out of your subject.  9</td>', 'Very excellent image... I love the mood created here.  The sharpness is quite perfect really, I can''t really ask for much more here, as you''ve made the very most out of your subject.  9', '2010-07-12 22:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
