(6090484, 896868, 20168, '<td valign="top">I like the odd angle and subject</td>', 'I like the odd angle and subject', '2010-07-13 03:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090485, 896943, 27686, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, amazing textures, great B&amp;W!</td>', 'Great portrait, amazing textures, great B&W!', '2010-07-13 03:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090487, 896481, 27686, '<td valign="top">Amazing pic.</td>', 'Amazing pic.', '2010-07-13 03:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090488, 897000, 20168, '<td valign="top">like a few others, the use of HDR on this seems to be a bit overdone, but the intensity of the colors are great still and subject is fun</td>', 'like a few others, the use of HDR on this seems to be a bit overdone, but the intensity of the colors are great still and subject is fun', '2010-07-13 03:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090489, 896379, 20168, '<td valign="top">good macro image for the challenge</td>', 'good macro image for the challenge', '2010-07-13 03:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090509, 895912, 5822, '<td valign="top">Compelling portrait and composition. I really like his slanted shoulders and gentle downward cast gaze (as if a moment of reflection), though I think lack of eye contact can also be seen as a negative.  I may have flipped it horizontally so he''s looking in the opposite direction. I also like the busy background, though blurred enough for subject/bg separation it almost creates an environmental portrait, and an element of mystique as it makes me wonder his role/relationship. A technical issue I see is the obvious processing to burn in the overexposed highlights in his hair.</td>', 'Compelling portrait and composition. I really like his slanted shoulders and gentle downward cast gaze (as if a moment of reflection), though I think lack of eye contact can also be seen as a negative.  I may have flipped it horizontally so he''s looking in the opposite direction. I also like the busy background, though blurred enough for subject/bg separation it almost creates an environmental portrait, and an element of mystique as it makes me wonder his role/relationship. A technical issue I see is the obvious processing to burn in the overexposed highlights in his hair.', '2010-07-13 04:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090511, 897159, 5822, '<td valign="top">Sorry to say but the subject is an eyesore in the otherwise majestic and beautiful scene.</td>', 'Sorry to say but the subject is an eyesore in the otherwise majestic and beautiful scene.', '2010-07-13 04:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090516, 896637, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, lighting, and subject matter, and you would have had excellent color contrast and combination but your processing created a yellow that is just about the same color as anti-freeze, at least on my monitor, and you did not do enough to bring out the greens in the foliage. Shame really, cause this could have been very good. Sorry to be so blunt.</td>', 'Nice scene, lighting, and subject matter, and you would have had excellent color contrast and combination but your processing created a yellow that is just about the same color as anti-freeze, at least on my monitor, and you did not do enough to bring out the greens in the foliage. Shame really, cause this could have been very good. Sorry to be so blunt.', '2010-07-13 04:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090517, 896920, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the blue.</td>', 'I love the blue.', '2010-07-13 04:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090518, 897113, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice textures, but looks oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice textures, but looks oversharpened.', '2010-07-13 04:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090526, 897064, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture and composition, with beautiful muted colors, interesting prespective and texture. A watercolor painting with an aire of nostalgia. Well done!</td>', 'Lovely capture and composition, with beautiful muted colors, interesting prespective and texture. A watercolor painting with an aire of nostalgia. Well done!', '2010-07-13 04:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090530, 896062, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the wide angle/fisheye prespective, colors and textures. A bit soft, though, and I wish you had cloned out the extraneous debris in the sand.</td>', 'Love the wide angle/fisheye prespective, colors and textures. A bit soft, though, and I wish you had cloned out the extraneous debris in the sand.', '2010-07-13 04:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090534, 896975, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice HDR and light for a nostalgic effect. Love the muted colors. Good detail in the window too, but I wish I could see a bit more of the inside (as opposed to the building''s reflection) as it seems there is a person working inside (but then again, I could be imagining it).</td>', 'Nice HDR and light for a nostalgic effect. Love the muted colors. Good detail in the window too, but I wish I could see a bit more of the inside (as opposed to the building''s reflection) as it seems there is a person working inside (but then again, I could be imagining it).', '2010-07-13 04:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090536, 896909, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great find and excellent processing. Only critique I could say is I wish the floats were a bit more subdued in tone. Love it.</td>', 'Great find and excellent processing. Only critique I could say is I wish the floats were a bit more subdued in tone. Love it.', '2010-07-13 04:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090537, 897060, 5822, '<td valign="top">This has a really nice storybook feel to it.</td>', 'This has a really nice storybook feel to it.', '2010-07-13 04:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090538, 896722, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent processing to bring out the texture in the wood.</td>', 'Excellent processing to bring out the texture in the wood.', '2010-07-13 04:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090542, 897103, 5822, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t like his direct piercing gaze and expression, nor the flat lighting creating blown highlights in his hair.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t like his direct piercing gaze and expression, nor the flat lighting creating blown highlights in his hair.', '2010-07-13 04:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090546, 897106, 5822, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors, light, and long exposure effect. Gorgeous everything. A masterpiece. Has blue written all over it.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors, light, and long exposure effect. Gorgeous everything. A masterpiece. Has blue written all over it.', '2010-07-13 05:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090574, 897097, 97073, '<td valign="top">Would like to see this on the front page</td>', 'Would like to see this on the front page', '2010-07-13 06:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090575, 896481, 97073, '<td valign="top">Favourite so far.</td>', 'Favourite so far.', '2010-07-13 06:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090576, 896943, 97073, '<td valign="top">My pic for a ribbon!</td>', 'My pic for a ribbon!', '2010-07-13 06:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090577, 896449, 97073, '<td valign="top">Like the tones here. Good choice for a longer shutter speed.</td>', 'Like the tones here. Good choice for a longer shutter speed.', '2010-07-13 06:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090578, 896934, 97073, '<td valign="top">HDR works well here. Great tones in the sky.</td>', 'HDR works well here. Great tones in the sky.', '2010-07-13 06:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6090579, 896984, 97073, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the border but great shot.</td>', 'Not sure about the border but great shot.', '2010-07-13 06:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
