(6093809, 897034, 117474, '<td valign="top">In a morbid way I''ve always really liked graveyard shots. I think the shot''s well composed, but I find the trees in the background a little distracting. If there was a way to enhance the lettering on the gravestone it might have been nice to see them more clearly too.<br/>But, there''s a nice dissarray of stonesin the background. The trees in the BG aren''t as distracting as I first thought they were.</td>', 'In a morbid way I''ve always really liked graveyard shots. I think the shot''s well composed, but I find the trees in the background a little distracting. If there was a way to enhance the lettering on the gravestone it might have been nice to see them more clearly too.But, there''s a nice dissarray of stonesin the background. The trees in the BG aren''t as distracting as I first thought they were.', '2010-07-15 08:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
