(6096653, 896970, 49954, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by giantmike:</b></div><hr/><i> I have a feeling this was affected more by time than weather. That said, this photo does use depth of field pretty well. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Nope.  This was purely from heat. In fact, I was going to tone down the colors, but left the bright yellow not only as a play on "sun"stroke, but also to be very clear that it was not a time issue, but a weather issue.  Oh well :)</td>', 'Originally posted by giantmike: I have a feeling this was affected more by time than weather. That said, this photo does use depth of field pretty well.   Nope.  This was purely from heat. In fact, I was going to tone down the colors, but left the bright yellow not only as a play on "sun"stroke, but also to be very clear that it was not a time issue, but a weather issue.  Oh well :)', '2010-07-19 01:03:56.000000', NULL, 0),
