(6096716, 896859, 67697, '<td valign="top">ok i will tell you that I gave this a 4.  i felt it should have been in focus.  I think I can see what is going on.  Did you take this as a hand-held shot?  If you are going to use a speed of 1/25 you are going to need to rest this on something or use a tripod.  A slight shake will really show up in a macro.  I''ve found that hand held shots start to look ok at 1/50.  Do you see the blur in your subject?</td>', 'ok i will tell you that I gave this a 4.  i felt it should have been in focus.  I think I can see what is going on.  Did you take this as a hand-held shot?  If you are going to use a speed of 1/25 you are going to need to rest this on something or use a tripod.  A slight shake will really show up in a macro.  I''ve found that hand held shots start to look ok at 1/50.  Do you see the blur in your subject?', '2010-07-19 01:19:53.000000', NULL, 0),
