(6097066, 896959, 117285, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, colour and isolation.  I thought there would have been a lot more views like this in the competition but yours was the shining example.  In my top 3 of voting.</td>', 'Nice detail, colour and isolation.  I thought there would have been a lot more views like this in the competition but yours was the shining example.  In my top 3 of voting.', '2010-07-19 10:32:57.000000', NULL, 0),
