(6098680, 896880, 62895, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Some nice improvements you''ve been making. I always enjoy it when a photographer makes visible improvements as time goes on and you''ve been doing it very rapidly. Keep it up! ;-)</td>', 'Nice job. Some nice improvements you''ve been making. I always enjoy it when a photographer makes visible improvements as time goes on and you''ve been doing it very rapidly. Keep it up! ;-)', '2010-07-20 23:56:37.000000', NULL, 0),
