(6099256, 896922, 25143, '<td valign="top">this is part of the rooftop at one of the houses designed by Gaudi ; I inverted it to get the impression of spikes ( a technique often used by Gaudi himself whenever he used organic shapes for his buildings ). The sandstone shows traces of rain , so i thought it would fit the theme of "weathered" .</td>', 'this is part of the rooftop at one of the houses designed by Gaudi ; I inverted it to get the impression of spikes ( a technique often used by Gaudi himself whenever he used organic shapes for his buildings ). The sandstone shows traces of rain , so i thought it would fit the theme of "weathered" .', '2010-07-21 05:34:39.000000', NULL, 0),
